# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C11 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C11 equal 0.5*(-89729.9035428968+${C1pos})
variable C11 equal 0.5*(-89729.9035428968+90220.6919260088)
